# 16. SINGLE SERVICES VS COMBOS

This is a major business requirement.

The customer must clearly understand the difference between:

**Single services**
- Individual body-part waxing.
- Individual facials.
- Individual threading.
- Individual bleach and De-Tan.

**Combos**
- Multiple services together at a bundled price.
- Usually cheaper than booking the same eligible services individually.
- Clearly show included body parts.
- Clearly show the combo price.
- Show genuine savings only if the backend can calculate them correctly.

Do not automatically treat every combination of services as an official combo.

Only business-approved combinations should be published.

Create a flexible combo builder in the admin panel.

Admin can:
- Create a combo.
- Select included services.
- Set combo price.
- Configure duration.
- Mark free inclusions.
- Set start/end dates.
- Publish/unpublish.
- Feature a combo.

